    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automate Supplier Bill Entry from Invoices\nToday: Emma receives an email like \u201cDrainPro invoice [ref] - payment due in [n] days\u201d and then types it into accounts (enter supplier bill) by hand, about 28 times a month.\nEstimated time saved: 1.86 hours a month (an estimate; see the report).\nRisk: medium - Incorrect bill details entered into accounts could lead to overpayment or accounting errors.\n\nBefore switching on: set the trigger's credentials, ACCOUNTS_API_URL, APPROVAL_WEBHOOK_URL and AI_API_KEY in the n8n environment.",
